sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Browser
    participant Edge as Cloudflare edge
    participant Static as Static assets
    participant Fn as Pages Function
    participant D1 as D1

    Client->>Edge: GET a page
    Edge->>Static: Read the file
    Static-->>Edge: HTML, CSS, JS
    Edge-->>Client: Page with policy headers, no Function runs
    Client->>Edge: POST /api/contact or /api/csp-report
    Note over Edge,Static: WAF, rate limit, schema validation
    Edge->>Fn: API requests only
    Fn->>D1: Parameterized SQL write
    Fn-->>Client: JSON result
